/// End-to-end coverage for spec-3-2's save() leg — complements rather than
/// duplicates `audio_entry_cubit_test.dart` (mocked `MicRecorder`/
/// `AudioTranscriber` *and* mocked `EntriesRepository`, covers every cubit
